1. Frontend path correction

    Fixed the frontend path resolution for the desktop installer.
    Ensured the service can locate ui/dist/index.html when running from the compiled dist directory.
    Addressed the ENOENT error:
    text

    no such file or directory:
    client/services/ui/dist/index.html
    Addressed the browser error:
    text
    Cannot GET /ui/dist/index.html

2. Build system compatibility
Updated the build process to:

    Compile index.js separately using Babel.
    Compile all eight utility files into transpiled/utils/.
    Preserve the directory structure required by relative imports.
    Bundle the compiled service using @vercel/ncc.

This resolved the missing ./utils/configuration.js error.
3. SDB connection investigation

Reviewed the following areas:

    createAdbConnection(ip)
    Connection to port 26101.
    WebSocket Events.ConnectToTV.
    SDB connection timeout handling.
    ECONNREFUSED, ECONNRESET and connection-closed errors.
    TV IP address handling.

Important: We investigated the SDB connection issue, but did not establish a verified fix to the underlying adbhost protocol implementation. The library's packet handler does not implement ADB authentication (AUTH), which may be relevant to compatibility.
4. Features retained

The existing functionality was preserved:

    Tizen 3 installation support.
    Tizen 7+ certificate creation and package resigning.
    GitHub release installation.
    Local .wgt and .tpk installation.
    TV directory browsing.
    WebSocket communication.
    Certificate configuration management.
    Device profile transfer.

